==Descriptions==
'''Gingerbread Town''' is the map that was originally supposed to release during the [[Christmas 2019 Event]], but ended up being unused.

==Design & Path==
'''Gingerbread Town''' is a small town containing multiple gingerbread houses. A few candy canes, presents and snowmen are placed on the map. There is also a giant Christmas tree on the map.

The path starts at a cave and ends at another.



